        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AYAKAisDEAD&quot; is an adventure game set in the modern day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/7661bfd4c65e46231fa0f1ebf8314867.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, my dearest friend passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an unexpected accident—she must have still had so many things she wanted to do…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was asked to sort through her belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I picked up each item and drifted into thought, memories of her came flooding back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good memories, bad memories… none of them mean anything anymore to someone who’s no longer alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All I can do for her now is to carry those memories as I go on living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…But lately, something feels strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restless feeling deep in my chest—like she’s still here, close by, even though she’s supposed to be dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something lurking in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope it’s all just my imagination…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But could she have resented me without my realizing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just want to keep the memories we shared… as good memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.poster.avif?t=1768175577\" width=300 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.webm?t=1768175577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits—play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“She” is supposed to be “dead.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 30–60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/f8986ce0dc7f1bab1eb35895dada2c40.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and video content are allowed without prior permission, for both individuals and organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/63ee8c750e3eac0ffefea415fb64b5e3.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AYAKAisDEAD&quot; is an adventure game set in the modern day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/7661bfd4c65e46231fa0f1ebf8314867.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, my dearest friend passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an unexpected accident—she must have still had so many things she wanted to do…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was asked to sort through her belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I picked up each item and drifted into thought, memories of her came flooding back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good memories, bad memories… none of them mean anything anymore to someone who’s no longer alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All I can do for her now is to carry those memories as I go on living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…But lately, something feels strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restless feeling deep in my chest—like she’s still here, close by, even though she’s supposed to be dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something lurking in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope it’s all just my imagination…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But could she have resented me without my realizing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just want to keep the memories we shared… as good memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.poster.avif?t=1768175577\" width=300 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.webm?t=1768175577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits—play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“She” is supposed to be “dead.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 30–60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/f8986ce0dc7f1bab1eb35895dada2c40.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and video content are allowed without prior permission, for both individuals and organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/63ee8c750e3eac0ffefea415fb64b5e3.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p>",
